<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport"
          content="width=device-width, user-scalable=no, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, minimum-scale=1.0">
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="ie=edge">
    <title>Tayven McLellan</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/global.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/index.css">
    <script src="/js/simpleParallax.min.js" type="module"></script>
    <script src="/js/parallax.js" type="module"></script>
    <script src="/js/mobile-nav.js" type="module"></script>
    <script src="/js/hover-link.js" type="module"></script>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=McLaren&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
    <nav>
        <div class="logo"><a href='/'>TM</a></div>
        <button class="mobile-open"><img src="/assets/menu_icon.png" alt="open menu"></button>
        <ul>
            <li><a href="/">HOME</a></li>
            <li><a href="/mowing">MOWING</a></li>
            <li><a href="/products">PRODUCTS</a></li>
        </ul>
        <div class="cart"><a href="/cart"><img src="/assets/cart-icon.png" alt="cart"></a></div>
    </nav>
    <header>
        <h1><span class="drop-shadow">TAYVEN <br>McLELLAN</span><span class="blue">.</span></h1>
        <p id="header-message">Lawn mowing services and wooden kitchen tools based in the South Wairarapa</p>
        <video class="floating-video" autoplay loop muted>
            <source src="/assets/cutting-grass.mp4" type="video/mp4">
            Your browser does not support the video tag.
        </video>
    </header>
    <main>
        <article class="right-text">
            <h2>What do I do?</h2>
            <p>I provide quality grass-cutting services across the South Wairarapa and beyond, covering Martinborough, Featherston, Greytown, and Carterton. Caught or uncaught, any sized residential lawn, and any necessary weeding. <br>I guarantee reliable, everyday service for all my customers.</p>
        </article>
        <section class="hover-link">
            <a href="/mowing"><img src="/assets/snow-landscape.jpg" alt="a snowy landscape"></a>
            <div class="info-text">
                <h4>MOWING SERVICES</h4>
                <div class="info-text-body">
                    <p>
                        Fill out a quote form or contact me at PH <%= tayvenPhone %> and I'll contact you with a custom quote for any and all mowing jobs.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
        <article class="left-text">
            <h2>Wooden Wares</h2>
            <p>I make wooden kitchen wares like high-quality chopping boards, available for pickup in the South Wairarapa, and am always open to custom projects - just reach out and contact me through <%= tayvenEmail%> or PH <%= tayvenPhone%>.</p>
        </article>

        <section class="hover-link">
            <a href="/products"><img src="/assets/snow-landscape.jpg" alt="a snowy landscape"></a>
            <div class="info-text">
                <h4>BROWSE PRODUCTS</h4>
                <div class="info-text-body">
                    <p>Browse my list of products, create an order and submit it and I'll get back to you shortly. <br>
                    Please note, payment will be coordinated through email with internet banking.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>
    <footer>
<!--        content that slides-->
        <div class="marquee-track">
            <!--            two duplicate contents, but only the first is read by screen readers for accessibility purposes-->
            <div class="marquee-content">TAYVEN McLELLAN — I make quality wooden kitchen utensils and provide reliable lawn mowing services. Contact me through: <strong><a href="mailto://<%= tayvenEmail %>" class="dark-link"><%= tayvenEmail%></a></strong> or <strong><%= tayvenPhone %></strong>. Cart icon and mobile icon from <a href="https://magnific.com" class="dark-link">Magnific</a>. Free Stock Video Footage by <a href="http://www.videezy.com/" class="dark-link">Videezy</a></div>
            <div class="marquee-content" aria-hidden="true">TAYVEN McLELLAN — I make quality wooden kitchen utensils and provide reliable lawn mowing services. Contact me through: <strong><a href="mailto://<%= tayvenEmail %>" class="dark-link"><%= tayvenEmail%></a></strong> or <strong><%= tayvenPhone %></strong>. Cart icon and mobile icon from <a href="https://magnific.com" class="dark-link">Magnific</a>. Free Stock Video Footage by <a href="http://www.videezy.com/" class="dark-link">Videezy</a></div>
        </div>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
